# Gallery, media SoT, branding

## Media source of truth

- Canonical staged store: `assets/media/` (+ mirror `web/public/media/`).
- Manifest: `assets/media/manifest.json`. Inventory/docs: `docs/MEDIA-INVENTORY.md`.
- Upstream vault (refresh): MWTDAM `tattoo-designs/tattoo/` via `npm run curate:media`.
- Lineage: `parentSourceId` null = SoT original; walk parents to SoT; siblings share a parent.
- Cross-repo ingest (push to DAM / send graphics into Gallery): personal skill `dammwt-push-media` → `npm run push:media` (see `.cursor/skills/dammwt-push-media/`).

## Gallery file links

| Field | Role |
|-------|------|
| `previewUrl` | Display only — Electron `file://…/assets/media/…`, web `/media/…` |
| `localPath` | Disk path (manifest: repo-relative; Electron seed: absolute under `assets/media/`) |
| `cloudUrl` | Optional `http(s)` Notion/Drive/CDN; often null in curated set |

Electron IPC (paths under allowed media roots only): reveal in Finder, open local file, open cloud. Web: copy path / download `/media` / open cloud link. After schema or link changes, re-seed before review.

## MWT branding (brief)

- Brand assets: `assets/brand/` (hard-linked into web + renderer). See `docs/BRAND-ASSETS.md`.
- Surfaces: navy `#0A192F`. Accent gold `#D4AF37` (not yellow). Cream text `#f4ede1`.
- Gallery red–gold: gold primary; red `#FF0000` sparingly (borders/motifs). Red fills retired for new brand art.
- Product naming in UI: **MWT DAM** / Media Wave Technology.
